  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p05251",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "但愿‘没入’而已。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I only wish to sink away, nothing more.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p05251",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "匂亲王看了这诗，号啕大哭起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Niou read this poem and began to sob aloud.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p05251",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "他想：“如此看来，她毕竟是爱我的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He thought, \"From this, it seems she did love me after all.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p05251",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "浮舟那忧郁的面影就一直浮现在他眼前。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ukifune's melancholy face kept appearing before his eyes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p05251",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "那端庄的薰大将呢，从容不迫地展读浮舟的复书，想道：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As for the dignified General Kaoru, he calmly opened and read Ukifune's reply, and thought:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p05251",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "“可怜啊！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"How pitiful!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p05251",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "她在那里何等寂寞无聊！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "How lonely and weary she must be there!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p05251",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "便觉此人非常可爱。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then he felt that she was very dear to him.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p05251",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "浮舟的答诗是：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ukifune's reply poem was:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
